msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A824F1AA_C091_499F_A49D_2C364E7DBAFF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫The beast’s humanity began slipping away from him after that encounter."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫A humanidade da fera começou a se esvair depois daquele encontro."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CA94BCBB_0A21_4D60_AE2F_488D4AF685ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c73018ed1f9771704ad69824652b0bc1bcbec0f7881fc986a2dd97999484aaef
#. default-sha256: c3693ae43fe9258fb4066b3bf29624c293dfa12868e7851ea149a1a30613c561
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CA94BCBB_0A21_4D60_AE2F_488D4AF685ED"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had returned to the thing I had found in the cellar. ⟪k:1⟫Actually, he prowled the "
"mansion’s halls looking more barbaric than ever."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele voltou a ser a coisa que eu encontrei no porão. ⟪k:1⟫Na verdade, ele rondava os "
"corredores da mansão parecendo mais bárbaro do que nunca."

#: scenario2:scenario2_0629C26B_E63D_4C99_96A0_0C3420D6F21C
