#: scenario2:scenario2_BD734C9A_6BE8_4DF1_A1F8_9420881B20A6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc61e3709f4070cf84287c806b99c3f2596a3f049d9b73fee810ec6e501b9879
