msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7BEAD8C7_5402_4EAA_B237_D81D80A53B63"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And I’ve always known it!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E eu sempre soube disso!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_042BD0C6_56E9_4935_A39D_6D2E017DDBF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1cdf06d9f550ed3a93ad509f9546bcaade887b6dbf89b2f39a5ae9b6f27dfd0a
#. default-sha256: 41ac9391cce6b12d905412de468a8aa63290c140a2768082bc2c8fb9884ef970
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_042BD0C6_56E9_4935_A39D_6D2E017DDBF0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You said this mansion fulfills people’s desires!⟪k:1⟫Then... ⟪k:2⟫Then..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Você disse que esta mansão atende aos desejos das pessoas!⟪k:1⟫Então...Então... "

#: scenario2:scenario2_ABAFA661_B50D_44A5_A9CC_F2392825F410
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d237812401eb7e1e64ab07ceaabba15a3ea821458a7298320fb5a38dd6d1c14
#. default-sha256: faa986b15edaa2dc41f266185f61dc06f3a0aff28b15460dd13fcc4c83d00b14
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_ABAFA661_B50D_44A5_A9CC_F2392825F410"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Give me prey!⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫No more hares—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫live "
"humans⟪k:12⟫!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Dê-me presas!⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Chega de lebres—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫"
"humanos vivos⟪k:12⟫!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_36216E4E_37A8_4288_9365_AC3C7D3298A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1999ae50931864003515139f313db2125ee953f863746bcd7f90c3d01ff94cc7
#. default-sha256: 368692970ca606f9882f334a40680491d4a900dca9242bcb2ba18d34c89213d4
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_36216E4E_37A8_4288_9365_AC3C7D3298A5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why did I ever teach him to speak human language?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Por que o ensinei a falar a língua humana, eu me pergunto?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3956845F_F173_49C2_B599_3DC3CE06B064
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 52cb9562fbe46eddf702b399e754f8acab25e3209d203267fb7cdffe75c394e9
#. default-sha256: df9776d0fb553eb836857ab2d1020e46e9f00409e785657fb0e0cfc059df967d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3956845F_F173_49C2_B599_3DC3CE06B064"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Before long, the mansion granted his wish."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Em pouco tempo, a mansão atendeu ao seu desejo."

#: scenario2:scenario2_2D3DB347_9C5C_4348_9141_8DBA4EE15AA9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bde7cb12ccf8deb2a53c92610a482e242d0294e142f201de7bfccc0b3337ca00
#. default-sha256: 0d85808e91db4d1c9cd7bc274c7e533cb6164c3f0194293bd49c9d393c2e92b1
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2D3DB347_9C5C_4348_9141_8DBA4EE15AA9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Once a week, a villager or a traveling merchant from somewhere would wander into the forest, "
"ending up at the mansion on the cliff."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Uma vez por semana, um aldeão ou comerciante viajante vagava pela floresta e acabava na "
"mansão do penhasco."

#: scenario2:scenario2_EC3E1937_F81D_450E_AE1A_5424CC1137AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a972d2cc961d2d41763d796536e7331c643a59cb8ff77fb33e3d445fe689588
#. default-sha256: a9e277850a430f270409f3ba0ea04c4b204c5385360e04e2cf045732588eceb4
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_EC3E1937_F81D_450E_AE1A_5424CC1137AF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though something ⟪k:1⟫felt⟪k:2⟫ suspicious about the man who greeted them at the door, on "
"the surface, he looked like a proper nobleman..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Embora houvesse algo ⟪k:1⟫suspeito⟪k:2⟫ no homem que os recebia à porta, por fora ele "
