msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫And by killing... ⟪k:8⟫no one can defy me!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫E na matança...⟪k:8⟫ninguém consegue me desafiar!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_5A82AD4A_21A6_4804_91A1_325B50427DA4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3552e15ca74e8fd7fa82d4f067374911fefa8f3e3187dd8f95b3980dc532104d
#. default-sha256: 6a0512d33efd2cd28ea9ea28c143070218f294fd28c86eb3a8a60894869c4f77
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5A82AD4A_21A6_4804_91A1_325B50427DA4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I have to show the world that I—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫that beasts are the most frightening "
"things on this earth!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eu tenho que mostrar ao mundo que eu—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫que as feras são as coisas mais "
"assustadoras desta terra!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_8BDF044C_D186_4600_9FE0_2F771AD37AA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c87df0c23742964df7766c9b1e8e561c661962476da4c4691c32bc03c9104fcb
#. default-sha256: a1b2119e568a108578221325f3f95f1c3fa1baefd18fee18f7a81978826a96e8
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_8BDF044C_D186_4600_9FE0_2F771AD37AA8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The beast began to change his style, making sick banquets out of his kills."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A fera começou a mudar seu estilo, fazendo banquetes doentios com seus abates."

#: scenario2:scenario2_6D0F9BE3_EE7F_4A02_9B59_FD751F965ABD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 974d5716c294079bc747c2c53c7e78e0fd4586ce08629c58b9f48d1bdb061faa
#. default-sha256: 39d5676ac4091b4d0e7a232ab3e98f36a4e5c885ce4e2537081df5e372b48904
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6D0F9BE3_EE7F_4A02_9B59_FD751F965ABD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Some days, he would tie his guests up in the cellar, playing with them for hours until they "
"finally died. Some days, he would drain them of their blood and bathe in it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Em alguns dias, ele amarrava seus convidados no porão, brincando com eles por horas até que "
"finalmente morressem. Em outros, ele drenava o sangue deles e se banhava nele."

#: scenario2:scenario2_43450F3B_CB83_4100_A6A9_9D62AAD5DF0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 792feb84e7f35303b4d59061fce7c08101c357ab331f2c775fbcb1f803e242a6
#. default-sha256: 4fce4a29e78c4536187900fad925e3bd01dd8662772c075b7c4cb9076c17a02d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_43450F3B_CB83_4100_A6A9_9D62AAD5DF0F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Some days, he would spread them out on the table and feast upon them."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Às vezes, os espalhava sobre a mesa e se banqueteava com eles."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C090D098_8DF8_4383_BAEF_1AEA5CC2C259
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d39beccf2e4ec43004597302bbc39e9e47c32eaa0b77d6bc1a07e338f3dba263
#. default-sha256: f4a2b53ef7eb03594620de2302250b492a1203be1515df97933a412d6d47ad9c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C090D098_8DF8_4383_BAEF_1AEA5CC2C259"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Every week, another atrocious party. He did everything imaginable."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Toda semana, outra festa abominável. Ele fez tudo que se possa imaginar."

#: scenario2:scenario2_06FE9D10_1C06_46A2_9E94_CF2DE181C38A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 735e36b38613d72778f329eccf629139b2daf21bb2bf237b02ae7f417381b240
#. default-sha256: 8a760561fcec49736536b1b627373703dead86ba486f2ef13e3631f1035fae26
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_06FE9D10_1C06_46A2_9E94_CF2DE181C38A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As a faithful servant of this house,⟪k:1⟫I am confident I can do most anything I am asked."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Como serva fiel desta casa,⟪k:1⟫tenho confiança em que posso fazer quase tudo o que me pedem."

#: scenario2:scenario2_F4AF7F68_0BC0_4848_92DB_988A42C2FD80
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c9b81446964f928e4d15fcee3ba7a66721faf13dcc535c0143019e76b093638d
#. default-sha256: f8895d94ecd73665e7047c1daa21f98a3e45f9cdabd9ce55d1de33483b61ec50
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F4AF7F68_0BC0_4848_92DB_988A42C2FD80"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though you can surely imagine my surprise at having to use the cooking skills I learned "
"while serving the flaxen-haired family to do ⟪k:1⟫that⟪k:2⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Embora você certamente possa imaginar minha surpresa em ter que usar as habilidades "
"culinárias que aprendi enquanto servia a família de cabelos de linho para fazer ⟪k:1⟫isso⟪k:2⟫."

#: scenario2:scenario2_530C961D_CCDA_4F61_845A_C516BABF7908
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 880131f316a45c4df79831faab72141d6b928ac3c85df08296ab99e40c2ba10e
#. default-sha256: b3c7ee3531c647cd9805c2ce6a49c1ab8ea84e6367b650e5f8ce01dd356c5835
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_530C961D_CCDA_4F61_845A_C516BABF7908"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I can only wonder if it actually tasted any good."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eu me pergunto se realmente chegava a ter um gosto bom."

#: scenario2:scenario2_0C5BD24B_7281_4455_A109_26B21102000D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 480a0ea2e29ca75176154279c3f01163037bbaa2129f681701d0985bd63f36db
#. default-sha256: 96d6af3a0ce953fcdf28aa47cfccc476877fd929c4bf39a1bbb9ab8639c8145a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0C5BD24B_7281_4455_A109_26B21102000D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Bestia’s peculiar sword was always with him for his twisted banquets of self-gratification. "
"⟪k:1⟫However much blood stained it, it never lost its sheen."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A espada peculiar de Bestia estava sempre com ele em seus depravados banquetes de "
"autogratificação. ⟪k:1⟫Por mais sangue que a manchasse, ela nunca perdeu o brilho."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1953702F_7296_4723_BCE0_1F8BD83EACCE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cce7a87b146a2e9ea829c869dd66084c2926518c79d03be87c9f5bcaf4cdfcd6
#. default-sha256: 529ffb8e4309698abaaf1121a63c841fb34cfc7f8fd44a5c15dd184809050d03
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1953702F_7296_4723_BCE0_1F8BD83EACCE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was as though the sword drank of the flesh of humans."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era como se a espada bebesse da carne dos humanos."

#: scenario2:scenario2_8542B195_B8E7_4EAE_8626_225DEC8E1FDB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1877f69a9a2b821006aa2ad468b47553458d95284292216acf2c7b32c11c20d
#. default-sha256: b748b55ffd3f97df371ea06b1bb8190d8fb299db6b19a9a2af4a032107144851
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_8542B195_B8E7_4EAE_8626_225DEC8E1FDB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Master, can you imagine just how wretched I felt?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mestre, você pode imaginar o quão miserável eu me senti?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_35809AC2_871E_4E58_ACF8_77BC037F72A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d07dd7583096064ba72d02f6d8c92fc2210946eb1f876fbdb4db28d90a0f40e
#. default-sha256: 1d9de10832d9efcdd44190fcfd0345a685eddd8116d6ff197dc7265f8cedbd7b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_35809AC2_871E_4E58_ACF8_77BC037F72A7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The mansion, once a beautiful sight to behold, reeked of death and acrimony."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫A mansão, outrora uma bela imagem de se ver, cheirava a morte e amargura."

#: scenario2:scenario2_689F9549_2E43_45D4_8E24_B15BC5CDB8A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22ab343255bb2ce6b3cf11136bcecec3ad705030c5818622606be43a5abf8833
#. default-sha256: 8dfdb534797bb6e7c194cc565fa3181720b59dff15c8a01067478c1f24f762fe
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_689F9549_2E43_45D4_8E24_B15BC5CDB8A7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The stench of rotting flesh seeped up from the cellar."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫O fedor de carne podre infiltrava-se do porão."

#: scenario2:scenario2_5BF7EDE5_0CBD_45DB_B4EC_8AC9173E9A8C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2d2d20f1925d0b448ebf5eb3c3947771a0c0f41c9fe80ae1fa2f47b64fca5ec
#. default-sha256: 6814991f704e0f4f903ffad5f6da440da4a03c21fbd1d23143c789fa1990bc46
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5BF7EDE5_0CBD_45DB_B4EC_8AC9173E9A8C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Even the years it spent forsaken and in ruins were preferable to that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mesmo os anos em que esteve abandonada e em ruínas eram preferíveis a isso."

#: scenario2:scenario2_FA8D4794_63A8_4D8F_A7EB_100E4A25EC3B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b066ec6564f85ecbf21066f971b50e48cd38aa0f7b211951cdd4bc0963e1ca5
#. default-sha256: 8a69ea7c615ea67d56b47e5ac211685d33768e6a84f95f2472cd56fa5ba61226
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_FA8D4794_63A8_4D8F_A7EB_100E4A25EC3B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Or perhaps I only had myself to blame."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ou talvez eu fosse a única a culpar."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E3B343BD_E899_4022_9C41_51CE8670C6E6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66c3d2a356310d2c8f8dc93d1f0e44b30e6b49bde4f8b81a38e06ee1b3698f14
#. default-sha256: 326f3f423d537d0baadb272609e970e9e64ddc6fa74acf21a91eb8f2a4e95d6c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E3B343BD_E899_4022_9C41_51CE8670C6E6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was I who had invited the beast into the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Fui eu quem convidou a fera para a mansão."

#: scenario2:scenario2_FF896223_520A_4C04_8CE2_96126F1601DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d52e5680a9588645ec9f9dc4aad2ed66eff926f020e9862e4c80e6535121c81
#. default-sha256: 03715febb400aa38a4ec3107c8fd38707d18fd13d626b40aed212c89d5183ad5
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_FF896223_520A_4C04_8CE2_96126F1601DC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫More, ⟪k:1⟫moooore⟪k:2⟫... ⟪k:3⟫Not enough...⟪k:4⟫This isn’t enough to satisfy me..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais, ⟪k:1⟫maaaais⟪k:2⟫...⟪k:3⟫Não é suficiente...⟪k:4⟫Isto não é suficiente para me "
"satisfazer..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_15FEBCF0_88B6_45E8_86BF_74FECCE3C1F4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cacb96bba2c05c7d404ab45ed18987cfca62e3cb26ca06ef39f909440cd98b13
#. default-sha256: 68269a595ab3bfbe6ed07841da32c874af7067b32db7b0d9e769eb68ef83a18d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_15FEBCF0_88B6_45E8_86BF_74FECCE3C1F4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But Bestia still sought to hold more of his perverse parties.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Lost villagers were "
"no longer enough to quell his urges."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas Bestia ainda procurava realizar mais de suas festas perversas.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Aldeões perdidos "
"não eram mais suficientes para reprimir seus impulsos."

#: scenario2:scenario2_9E470691_8AFE_449B_B23A_2012264CBAE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8973b7fa6a0d45b7ea912bedc489135c8dcf40ff367890c472f0003bfcc13c1d
#. default-sha256: 42d064c2cded6bcf94ac81c5182e9bf82f288fa3da19a2421fb2446a3c7ccb75
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_9E470691_8AFE_449B_B23A_2012264CBAE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was, indeed, a genuine beast.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And in time, this is what he began to wish for:"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele era, de fato, genuinamente uma fera.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫E com o tempo, foi isto que ele começou a "
"desejar:"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7B5A78AB_13CA_492C_9571_D09676070009
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 26c56548f0fa303ed3805b897b7cc0c7d624fcbd576aeb2a74b6b675c52922e7
#. default-sha256: c12cb650c59a7afb6b7dece43ce5081e80a846b49e8a6ea185ae936023cd2b55
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7B5A78AB_13CA_492C_9571_D09676070009"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Can’t you get me any better prey?!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Something truly exquisite!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The perfect "
"prey to quench this maddening thirst of mine!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Você não pode me arranjar uma presa melhor?!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Algo verdadeiramente requintado!⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫A presa perfeita para saciar esta minha sede enlouquecedora!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_B2F77B85_76EC_4DBB_9564_A2739C441FAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a3750db46e2164c287bda113ecb7822e561a52d993349feb85b0cd4eb2a0b6b
#. default-sha256: d84b2abd90af91f687069f4e13b99f9c69f9340cab6cc844bfb4107bff553424
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B2F77B85_76EC_4DBB_9564_A2739C441FAA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Do you know what he meant when he asked for the “perfect” prey, Master?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Você sabe o que ele quis dizer quando pediu a presa “perfeita”, Mestre?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A9170792_5C88_465B_BDB7_DBDD7D3CFC33
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47a4faaddefc05bfa239176c78ab7c4803e551b627eb75a361db5a8965f92129
#. default-sha256: a9e6f8f58892c991e7253d29d7e293a2ab96142050521fc4c41b6bf4e2591784
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A9170792_5C88_465B_BDB7_DBDD7D3CFC33"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Perhaps a hero, someone courageous enough to stand up to him, with whom he could enjoy a "
"battle to the death."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Talvez um herói, alguém corajoso o suficiente para enfrentá-lo, com quem ele pudesse "
"desfrutar de uma batalha até a morte."

#: scenario2:scenario2_ED8F0C0F_DF6E_4C21_8DD8_E3C6463496E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62ca02c6c4967e8a134e12739a3f6ac2e51c2df41c03de47603fb0ae675d346d
#. default-sha256: 63ea7442a35cd7d72d0852e6454a298586451e24961e4a9a76dcc0fa779239f6
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_ED8F0C0F_DF6E_4C21_8DD8_E3C6463496E0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Perhaps a dazzling young nymph to satisfy his other primal urges.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Or perhaps what "
"he wanted was not human at all,⟪k:3⟫but a demon or a phantom."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Talvez uma jovem ninfa deslumbrante para satisfazer seus outros impulsos primitivos.⟪k:1⟫"
"⟪k:2⟫Ou talvez o que ele queria não fosse humano,⟪k:3⟫mas um demônio ou um fantasma."

#: scenario2:scenario2_4BDF0F89_2E12_4091_8E35_7392A6CC8A44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c518fd441cc232ac5814192be4930c6c78f7e4da3b6315e46067043689bf59e
#. default-sha256: 2dcfdbb0ea4d7447e5aeed9bdd3ebaa0a484782bffdc2c4ee693237cdfd2956e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4BDF0F89_2E12_4091_8E35_7392A6CC8A44"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I would soon find out, as the mansion attempted to grant his wish, bringing yet another "
"guest to the house on the cliff.⟪k:1⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu logo descobriria, enquanto a mansão tentava realizar seu desejo, trazendo mais um "
"convidado para a casa no penhasco.⟪k:1⟫"
